eToCallMultipleTimes only verifies that repeated Close calls do not panic; it never emits a log after Close or checks that the logger state no longer references the closed writer.\",\"suggestedRegressionTest\":\"Add a test that installs a file-backed logger, closes it, then logs again with a captured default/stderr logger or reinitialization expectation, asserting the post-Close record is not silently lost through the closed bufio.Writer.\",\"minimumFixScope\":\"cmd/entire/cli/logging/logger.go Close state reset plus one logger_test.go post-Close behavior test\"}],\"inspected\":{\"files\":[\"cmd/entire/cli/logging/context.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/logging/logger.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/logging/context_test.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/logging/logger_test.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/agent/types/agent.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/paths/paths.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/paths/transcript.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/paths/worktree.go\",\"cmd/entire/cli/validation/validators.go\"],\"symbols\":[\"WithSession\",\"WithParentSession\",\"WithToolCall\",\"WithComponent\",\"WithAgent\",\"SessionIDFromContext\",\"ParentSessionIDFromContext\",\"ToolCallIDFromContext\",\"ComponentFromContext\",\"AgentFromContext\",\"Init\",\"Close\",\"resetLogger\",\"createLogger\",\"parseLogLevel\",\"isValidLogLevel\",\"Debug\",\"Info\",\"Warn\",\"Error\",\"LogDuration\",\"log\",\"attrsFromContext\",\"ValidateSessionID\",\"WorktreeRoot\"],\"notes\":[\"Reviewed the owned logging package files and the linked tests as evidence of intended behavior.\",\"Did not run the full test suite; this was a source review of the supplied feature scope.\"]}}","phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":null}}
